A br separates words, and a wbr joins the two parts of a word.
-- input.html --
<body><p>One<br>Two</p><p>super<wbr>word</p></body>
-- want.html --
<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title></title>
<link rel="canonical" href="http://example.com/"/></head>
<body data-id="0"><p data-id="1">One Two</p><p data-id="2">superword</p></body></html>
